  "label": "Anti-Black Racism Stereotype",
  "description": "The text attacks the 'government' and implies that Black people (the subject's race) are being brought in and are dangerous. This ties into broader anti-Black stereotypes that associate Black people with criminality and violence. The visual of a Black man smiling is juxtaposed with this hateful message, which is a common tactic to dehumanize and incite fear toward Black communities.",
